# Strimzi Ops — agent instructions

## What this repo is

Ops toolkit for Kafka Connect on Strimzi: connector **lint**, **monitor**, and **control**.

## Language

Application code is **Rust only** under `crates/`. Prefer putting new domain logic in `strimzi-ops-core`.

1. **Done:** lint/schema, Connect client, control/monitor library, `strimzi-ops` CLI
2. **Done:** Axum + HTMX UI (`strimzi-ui`) — Dashboard, Control, timed Monitor, kubectl logs
3. **Done:** Python package and `uv` tooling removed

## Where standards live

- Rust style: [docs/rust-best-practices.md](docs/rust-best-practices.md) — **must follow** [Canonical Rust best practices](https://canonical.github.io/rust-best-practices/introduction.html)
- Cursor rules: `.cursor/rules/` (this file + Rust-specific rules)

## Workspace layout

```
crates/strimzi-ops-core/   # library (lint, connect, control, monitor, k8s, settings)
crates/strimzi-ops/        # binaries: strimzi-ops + strimzi-lint
crates/strimzi-ui/         # Axum + Askama + HTMX web UI (default just run/ui)
```

## Checks before finishing Rust work

```bash
just rust-check   # fmt + clippy -D warnings
just rust-test
```
